    "Please report this issue to the %@ (not Homebrew/* repositories), or even better, submit a PR to fix it:" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "请将此问题报告给 %@（而不是 Homebrew/* 仓库）；更好的做法是提交 PR 来修复：" } } } },
